{"4580510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "United2030", "steam_appid": 4580510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>United2030 is a third-person 3D action game where you travel through cube-shaped portals and explore a variety of futuristic worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alice,Iris : CV 伊藤ゆり奈　様</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United2030: CV 羽山太洋　様<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras/139a1c7f7171cddf174a8d0b1c629326.avif?t=1788102541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras_big/139a1c7f7171cddf174a8d0b1c629326.avif?t=1788102541 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras/5fcd8f19dc2f722e7a278a5da2463bc8.avif?t=1788102541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras_big/5fcd8f19dc2f722e7a278a5da2463bc8.webp?t=1788102541 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras/ecbf9f5e6cf0ed3a117818ec54040717.poster.avif?t=1788102541\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras/ecbf9f5e6cf0ed3a117818ec54040717.webm?t=1788102541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras/ecbf9f5e6cf0ed3a117818ec54040717.mp4?t=1788102541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the story, search for hidden portals, and travel into new and unknown areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of environments, including realistic forests, massive futuristic fortresses, and towering cities filled with advanced technology. Each area offers a different atmosphere, enemies, and exploration experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you will encounter hostile robots that have gone out of control. Fight against different enemy types, including robots that chase you down and enemies that attack from a distance with waves of projectiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to earn experience points and coins, level up, and strengthen your character as you continue your journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online Co-op for Up to 8 Players</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >United2030 supports online cooperative multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras/c5111dcb142d66f115146a499faf7fb1.avif?t=1788102541\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras_big/c5111dcb142d66f115146a499faf7fb1.webp?t=1788102541 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras/8f4e5d1ba21ff69537cd95f3d1c89b36.poster.avif?t=1788102541\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras/8f4e5d1ba21ff69537cd95f3d1c89b36.webm?t=1788102541\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4580510/extras/8f4e5d1ba21ff69537cd95f3d1c89b36.mp4?t=1788102541\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ruined world of 2030 together with friends or other players. Work as a team to overcome enemies, explore dangerous areas, and progress through the world more effectively.</p><p class=\"